   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks for the response! For the DEC and DEC+J models, I have include_null_range set to False. In the script that I included with the original post, I&#39;m just trying to run DEC model. &quot;include_null_range&quot; occurs once in the script and the output still is reading the geography file wrong. <div><br></div><div>Jenna </div></div>"
