     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Apr 5, 2018 at 6:47 AM, Jenna Mccullough <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mccullou...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
